{"sha": "bbffa5e0fcf1921c4622e8c93d9e3b776c38161fb6ff71b135dc530f785daf63", "body": ["\\chapter{滤波器与传递函数}\\label{ch:b1:filters-transfer-functions}", "", "在音箱内部，一个线圈与一个电容器不用任何晶体管，", "就决定低音送往大纸盆、高音送往小球顶。", "示波器上的“AC”按钮能去掉缓慢漂移的直流偏移，", "只保留叠加其上的起伏。电源借助一个电容器，", "把脉动的整流市电变为平稳的电压。", "这三者都是\\emph{滤波器}：线性电路，各自对不同频率", "区别对待。任何周期信号都是正弦波之和，因此知道", "电路对每个正弦波的作用 --- 即其传递函数 --- 就等于", "知道它对一切信号的作用。本章定义传递函数，", "画出前几章中一阶与二阶电路的伯德图，", "并借此", "预测方波经滤波器后的输出形式。", "", "\\section{传递函数与伯德图}", "", "\\begin{definition}[传递函数]\\label{def:b1:filters-transfer-functions:H}", "\\index{传递函数}\\index{增益}\\index{滤波器}", "线性电路的输入电压为 $\\underline U_e$，输出电压为", "$\\underline U_s$（输出端不接任何负载），其", "\\emph{传递函数}为", "\\[", "\\underline H(j\\omega) = \\frac{\\underline U_s}{\\underline U_e},", "\\qquad G(\\omega) = \\abs{\\underline H}, \\qquad \\varphi(\\omega) = \\arg\\underline H,", "\\]", "其中\\emph{增益} $G$（即振幅之比）与", "输出相对于输入的相移 $\\varphi$。\\emph{滤波器}是指为利用其", "频率依赖性而使用的此类电路：振幅为 $E$ 的正弦量在", "$\\omega$ 时的输出为 $G(\\omega)E\\cos(\\omega t + \\varphi(\\omega))$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{definition}[分贝；伯德图]\\label{def:b1:filters-transfer-functions:bode}", "\\index{分贝}\\index{伯德图}\\index{截止频率}\\index{通带}", "以\\emph{分贝}表示的增益为 $G_{\\mathrm{dB}} = 20\\log_{10}G$：", "倍数 $10$ 对应 \\qty{20}{dB}，倍数 $2$ 对应 \\qty{6}{dB}，$1/\\sqrt2$ 对应", "\\qty{-3}{dB}。\\emph{伯德图}以 $G_{\\mathrm{dB}}$ 与", "$\\varphi$ 相对于 $\\log_{10}\\omega$（或 $f$）作图。\\emph{截止", "频率}是 $G$ 降至 $G_{\\max}/\\sqrt2$ 处（较最大值低", "\\qty{-3}{dB}）；\\emph{通带}是指与最大值相差", "不超过 \\qty{3}{dB} 的频率范围。十倍频程是指频率之比为 $10$，", "倍频程是指频率之比为 $2$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{method}[滤波器类型的快速判断]\\label{met:b1:filters-transfer-functions:nature}", "计算之前先看极限情形：频率很低时，电容器", "相当于断路，线圈相当于导线；频率很高时情况", "恰好相反。把元件替换后，看输出是否等于输入", "（通过）还是为零（阻断）。低频通过、高频阻断为低通；", "反之为高通；高低频都阻断为带通；高低频都通过为带阻。", "再由分压关系计算 $\\underline H$。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\section{一阶滤波器}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[一阶低通滤波器]\\label{prop:b1:filters-transfer-functions:lowpass1}", "\\index{低通滤波器}\\index{积分器}", "输出取自 $C$ 两端的 RC 分压电路（或输出取自", "$R$ 两端的 RL 分压电路）具有", "\\[", "\\underline H = \\frac{1}{1 + j\\omega/\\omega_c}, \\qquad", "\\omega_c = \\frac{1}{RC} \\ \\Big(\\text{或 } \\frac{R}{L}\\Big),", "\\qquad G = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 + (\\omega/\\omega_c)^2}}, \\qquad", "\\varphi = -\\arctan\\frac{\\omega}{\\omega_c} .", "\\]", "伯德渐近线：$G_{\\mathrm{dB}} = 0$，对应 $\\omega \\ll \\omega_c$；", "对 $\\omega \\gg \\omega_c$，直线每十倍频程下降 \\qty{20}{dB}，", "两线相交于 $\\omega_c$，此处精确曲线为 \\qty{-3}{dB}，且", "$\\varphi = -45^\\circ$。当 $\\omega \\gg \\omega_c$ 时，$\\underline H \\approx", "\\omega_c/(j\\omega)$：输出正比于输入的\\emph{积分}", "--- 此时滤波器即为积分器。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "分压关系：", "\\[", "\\underline H = \\frac{1/jC\\omega}{R + 1/jC\\omega} = \\frac{1}{1 + jRC\\omega} .", "\\]", "远高于截止频率时，$1 + j\\omega/\\omega_c \\approx j\\omega/\\omega_c$，且", "将复振幅除以 $j\\omega$ 即为积分", "（见\\cref{prop:b1:sinusoidal-impedance:rules}）：$u_s \\approx \\omega_c\\int u_e\\,\\dd t$。", "$20\\log(\\omega_c/\\omega)$ 随 $\\omega$ 增大十倍而下降 \\qty{20}{dB}。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[一阶高通滤波器]\\label{prop:b1:filters-transfer-functions:highpass1}", "\\index{高通滤波器}\\index{微分器}", "输出取自 $R$ 两端的 CR 分压电路（或输出取自", "$L$ 两端的 LR 分压电路）具有", "\\[", "\\underline H = \\frac{j\\omega/\\omega_c}{1 + j\\omega/\\omega_c},", "\\qquad G = \\frac{\\omega/\\omega_c}{\\sqrt{1 + (\\omega/\\omega_c)^2}},", "\\qquad \\varphi = \\frac{\\pi}{2} - \\arctan\\frac{\\omega}{\\omega_c},", "\\]", "以 $\\omega_c$ 为界，低于它时每十倍频程上升 \\qty{20}{dB}，高于它则平坦，", "增益为 \\qty{-3}{dB}、相位为 $+45^\\circ$，二者均在 $\\omega_c$ 处。对于 $\\omega \\ll \\omega_c$，$\\underline H", "\\approx j\\omega/\\omega_c$：输出正比于", "输入的\\emph{微分}。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$\\underline H = R/(R + 1/jC\\omega) = jRC\\omega/(1 + jRC\\omega)$;", "乘以 $j\\omega$ 即为微分。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left, xlabel style={at={(axis description cs:0.5,-0.14)}, anchor=north}, width=7.4cm, height=5.2cm, xmode=log, xlabel={$\\omega/\\omega_c$},", "    ylabel={$G_{\\mathrm{dB}}$}, xmin=0.01, xmax=100, ymin=-42, ymax=6,", "    ytick={0,-20,-40}, yticklabels={$0$,$-20$,$-40$},", "    xtick={0.01,0.1,1,10,100}, xticklabels={$10^{-2}$,$10^{-1}$,$1$,$10$,$10^{2}$}]", "  \\addplot[omExo, dashed, domain=0.01:1, samples=2] {0};", "  \\addplot[omExo, dotted, domain=0.01:100, samples=2] {-3};", "  \\addplot[omExo, dashed, domain=1:100, samples=2] {-20*log10(x)};", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0.01:100, samples=200] {-10*log10(1 + x^2)};", "  \\addplot[omThm, thick, domain=0.01:100, samples=200] {-10*log10(1 + 1/x^2)};", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\footnotesize] at (axis cs:0.05,-7) {低通};", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\footnotesize] at (axis cs:30,-9) {高通};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}\\qquad", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left, xlabel style={at={(axis description cs:0.5,-0.14)}, anchor=north}, width=7.0cm, height=5.2cm, xmode=log, xlabel={$\\omega/\\omega_c$},", "    ylabel={$\\varphi$}, xmin=0.01, xmax=100, ymin=-1.8, ymax=1.8,", "    ytick={-1.5708,-0.7854,0,0.7854,1.5708}, yticklabels={$-\\frac{\\pi}{2}$,$-\\frac{\\pi}{4}$,$0$,$\\frac{\\pi}{4}$,$\\frac{\\pi}{2}$},", "    xtick={0.01,0.1,1,10,100}, xticklabels={$10^{-2}$,$10^{-1}$,$1$,$10$,$10^{2}$}]", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0.01:100, samples=200] {-rad(atan(x))};", "  \\addplot[omThm, thick, domain=0.01:100, samples=200] {rad(90 - atan(x))};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}